# One scalar sample from one channel of a kitbag sensor.
#
# Nested type with no fixed port identifier: it is never published on
# its own, only as an array element inside SensorFrame.1.0. That is
# what makes it useful here -- a build integration that compiles a
# top-level type but fails to compile the types it embeds is a broken
# integration, and this is the type that catches it.

uint8 channel
# Which channel of the sensor produced the sample.

float32 value
# The sample, in whatever unit the channel is defined to carry.

kitbag.Mode.1.0 mode
# Mode the sensor was in when the sample was taken. A sample taken in
# STANDBY is well-formed but should not be trusted for control.

@sealed
